    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EProposed open spaces and community facilities \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Emeet the following requirements: \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProvide safe, direct pedestrian and cycle access routes that link differing spaces to key routes and destinations both within the development and the surrounding area \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll routes are designed to be overlooked by surrounding buildings to provide natural surveillance, and include appropriate lighting to an adoptable standard to support safety and comfort \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhere appropriate, incorporate defensible features such as bollards, knee rails, or planting to prevent misuse by vehicles or off-road bikes, whilst maintaining accessibility for all users \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBe designed as a focal point within the streetscape, reinforcing the overall purpose as a central, accessible, and valued community assets \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDemonstrate how spaces and facilities will be managed and maintained to a high standard over the long term via a Management and Maintenance Plan as required B3 Welcoming place\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
    <developmentScales>
      <Value><![CDATA[[
  "Other Major Applications",
  "Major Residential Applications (10\u002B homes)"
]]]></Value>
    </developmentScales>
